# Ignore generated build artifacts and local tool caches
build/
**/build/
.gradle/
**/.gradle/
.idea/
**/.idea/
.kotlin/
**/.kotlin/
.vscode/
**/.vscode/
local.properties
*.apk
*.aab
*.apks
*.jks
*.keystore
